Dufit'ubumwe nyabwo, dufatanya.
Dukeneye kuzuzw'urukundo;
Tumurikirwe n'ubwiza bwawe.

Wumve Mwami amasengesho yacu,
Utwuzuz'Umwuka wawe;
Twigish'Ijambo ryawe, turimenye.
Dukeneye kuzuzw'urukundo;
Tumurikirwe n'ubwiza bwawe.

Tyo bavandimwe kubw'Umucunguzi,
Mutyo dufatane mu biganza;
Tugendane kugeza kw'iherezo;
Tubonesherejwe na Yesu Kristo.

Turitanze Mukiza utwakire;
